Xaili
$cards
DECK 1 SPADES

$initial
STAEGO 0 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
STAEGO 7 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
STAEGO 6 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

$moves
MOVE STAEGO STAEGO
DEST Suit {SPADES, CLUBS}
MOVE_STACK STAEGO STAEGO
DEST Size < 7
$win
OR
    AND
        PILE ALL STAEGO Empty
        PILE ALL STAEGO Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL STAEGO Empty
        PILE ALL STAEGO Empty
